Q1. Write a python program to accept a string and substring. Check if substring is present at the beginning using RE module.

[10 Marks]

# Q1 Solution

import re

string = input("Enter main string: ")
substring = input("Enter substring: ")

# Check if substring is at beginning using regex (^ indicates start)
pattern = "^" + re.escape(substring)

if re.match(pattern, string):
    print("Substring is present at the beginning of the string.")
else:
    print("Substring is NOT present at the beginning of the string.")


